  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Customer/Client)\n\n### How to log in to Capium 365? (Mobile)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 25 Jul, 2025 at  4:59 PM\n\n\t\tThe Capium 365 mobile app allows clients to access their accounting data, scan receipts, and share documents directly from their smartphone. \n\nLogging into Capium 365 \n\nAfter installation, follow these steps to sign in: \n\nLaunch the Capium 365 App from your home screen. \n\nEnter your Email ID, Capium will always send you an OTP whenever you are signing in on a new device or whenever a session times out. \n\nand Check your email for a 6-digit verification code. \n\nEnter the verification code in the app to verify your email address. \n\nPlease find the below screenshots:\n\nYou will need to set a PIN which will allow you to sign in to your app whenever you open it. If you forget your pin you will be able to reset that PIN. Please click here to be redirected to the reset PIN page. \n\nOnce logged in you would be redirected to the page below where you are able to scan receipts, scan invoice, link your bank account and access your dashboards. \n\nClick here to Downloading the App mobile devices\n\nhttps://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000270003?portalId=9000044273\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
